            <div xml:id="d763">

                <pb facs="0795" n="787" xml:id="pg787"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/713: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennedy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-09-06T22:00:00-04:00">September 6, 1938—10
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>502. For Rublee. Your 856, September 2, 4 p.m. Weddell telegraphs:</p>
                <p>[Here follows paraphrase of telegram No. 252, September 5, 9 p.m., <hi
                        rendition="#italic">supra.</hi>]</p>
                <p>Before instructing him to press the matter further we would appreciate any
                    comment you may wish to make.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
